The HQ wants to receive telemetry from multiple on-board devices.

Open data telemetry on lines 2 through 7.

You can do it sequentially:
    03
    OBUS
    04
    OBUS
    05
    OBUS
    ...

But the most efficient way to do that is a loop with JNZ instruction.
To organize a simple loop, you also need the DUP and SUB instructions:

    07  -- the initial loop counter
    NOP -- loop body - do something here
    01
    SUB -- decrement
    DUP
    01
    JNZ -- jump to the position 0001
        -- if the counter is > 0

Tech Support has unlocked the associated instructions.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- the initial data line to start
-- we're going to move down from here
07
-- enable the current dataline
DUP
OBUS
-- loop over
01
SUB
DUP
02
SUB
01
JNZ
